  (text "R5 with C3: 1.54 kHz; R3 with C2: 60.5 Hz\nG = 1 + Rf/(R5 || R3) = 2307 (67 dB) at full Distortion\nC5 with Rf = 100 kOhm: 15.9 kHz" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f4310cb6-a8c3-5b26-9598-ac60a9a3bbc8"))
  (text "Section 4 of the circuit notes: a non-inverting stage, G = 1 + Zf/Zg. Every value is reported [6]; the wiring is read from its\nschematic.\nUX1: modelled as an ideal op-amp plus a gain-bandwidth pole (GBW = 1 MHz, inferred; see the notes). The pedal also has C6 30 pF\nfrom the LM308's compensation pins [6]; the stock symbol has no such pins, so it is not drawn and is accounted for in GBW.\nRVX1: the A100K Distortion pot [6], wired as a rheostat. The log law, about 9 % at noon, is chosen (no source gives the taper).\nIn the pedal the legs return to ground and the + input is biased to half supply through R2 [6]; here the bias is the rail VB." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "78654fc6-09d8-59a8-aa43-300ff6ea6b72"))
